  "totalBlocks": 14,
  "translatedBlocks": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7826a151962684c6",
      "translationZh": "大家好——我正在开发 TensorSharp，一个开源的 LLM 推理引擎。以下是使用其原生 ggml_cuda 后端得到的最新 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash GGUF 测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e3866b6c3606a15",
      "translationZh": "配置：8× NVIDIA A40，按层拆分，F16 KV 缓存，配置的上下文长度为 65,536 个 token。预填充测量使用约 4.9K 个 token 的提示词，而非完整的上下文窗口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64f9cc79db0466aa",
      "translationZh": "最终优化结果——所有速度的单位均为 tokens/sec：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "466546dad067a0cc",
      "translationZh": "预填充 | 533–539 | 451.8–492.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad3d3a66177e4a59",
      "translationZh": "单请求解码 | 40.31–40.72 | 31.0–32.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ea40740b9087e40",
      "translationZh": "解码，2 个并发请求——总计 |— | 39.3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cf1376cfd4ff08d",
      "translationZh": "解码，4 个并发请求——总计 |— | 48.9",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a709185279700a9a",
      "translationZh": "解码，8 个并发请求——总计 |— | 48.5。— = 所引用的最终 Q2_K 复测中未报告。并发数据表示总吞吐量，而非单个请求的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6164db51a1d2d29",
      "translationZh": "带来差异的因素：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "361d2252bdedc178",
      "translationZh": "Q2_K：将约 60 GiB 的量化 Engram 表保留在 GPU 上，消除了依赖存储的查找。为每个 GPU 统一后端，还将解码图的拆分数量从约 570 减少到 8，降低了同步开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6723c669f300fed",
      "translationZh": "Q4_K_M：更大的 Engram 表保留在主机内存中。自动预热、更严格的显存预算管理以及按 token 批处理的解码，使预填充性能达到此前的约 1.9×，四请求吞吐量达到此前的约 2×。40 层中只有 1 层将其路由专家保留在 CPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13d0232b521510d1",
      "translationZh": "并行度更高并不一定更快：在这个没有 NVLink 的系统上，Q4_K_M 层拆分优于实验性的路由 MoE 张量并行：单流解码速度分别为 31–32.5 和 21.4–22 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ec03b64c73f9c06",
      "translationZh": "这些是项目方报告的吞吐量测量结果，并非冷启动耗时，也不代表在与另一个引擎的直接对比中获胜。数值结果及模型质量是否一致仍未得到证实，而且批处理可能改变生成的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "LLM inference engine",
      "briefZh": "大模型推理引擎",
      "explanationZh": "用于运行大型语言模型并生成输出的软件系统。"
    },
    {
      "term": "GGUF",
      "briefZh": "模型文件格式",
      "explanationZh": "用于存储模型权重及相关元数据的文件格式，常用于本地模型推理。"
    },
    {
      "term": "layer split",
      "briefZh": "按层拆分",
      "explanationZh": "将模型的不同层分配到多块 GPU 上运行。"
    },
    {
      "term": "KV cache",
      "briefZh": "键值缓存",
      "explanationZh": "缓存注意力计算中的键和值，避免生成后续 token 时重复计算。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Prefill",
      "briefZh": "预填充",
      "explanationZh": "模型处理输入提示词并建立缓存的阶段，与逐步生成输出的解码阶段不同。"
    },
    {
      "term": "context window",
      "briefZh": "上下文窗口",
      "explanationZh": "模型一次处理时可容纳的 token 范围；此处测试提示词并未占满配置的窗口。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Single-request decode",
      "briefZh": "单请求解码",
      "explanationZh": "仅运行一个请求时，模型逐步生成输出 token 的过程。"
    },
    {
